{"sha": "85a4aa46d4ab6bc642f20646f76593cda5f6f966183d3bb4bf596923e19e296c", "body": ["\\chapter{缓冲溶液与优势区域图}\\label{ch:g12:buffers-predominance}", "", "血液检验报告动脉血的 pH：正常时介于 7.38 与", "7.42 之间。运动中的肌肉向血液中释放酸，肺将", "二氧化碳排出血液，食物带入酸和碱；然而 pH", "几乎不变。一个酸碱共轭对，即一种酸及其自身的共轭碱，能吸收这些冲击。", "本章说明：在给定 pH 下，哪种形式的共轭对占优势，", "几滴有色共轭对如何显示 pH，", "以及酸与其共轭碱的混合物如何使 pH 保持稳定。", "", "\\begin{recall}", "酸碱共轭对、$K_a$ 与 $pK_a$；溶液的 pH", "（见\\cref{ch:g12:ka-and-pka}，\\cref{ch:g9:acids-bases-ph}）。", "\\end{recall}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.45\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g12-blood-tubes.jpg}", "", "{\\small 血样：其 pH 维持在很窄的范围内。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{优势区域图}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[亨德森关系式]\\label{prop:g12:buffers-predominance:henderson}", "在含有共轭对 \\ce{HA}/\\ce{A-} 的任意水溶液中，", "\\[", "  \\mathrm{pH} = pK_a + \\log\\frac{[\\ce{A-}]}{[\\ce{HA}]} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $K_a = \\dfrac{[\\ce{A-}][\\ce{H3O+}]}{[\\ce{HA}]c^\\circ}$，两边取 $-\\log$", "得 $pK_a = \\mathrm{pH} - \\log\\dfrac{[\\ce{A-}]}{[\\ce{HA}]}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[优势区域图与分布图]\\label{def:g12:buffers-predominance:predominance}", "共轭对的 \\emph{优势区域图}\\index{优势区域图} 是在", "$pK_a$ 处分割的 pH 轴：低于此值时，酸 HA 占优势", "（$[\\ce{HA}] > [\\ce{A-}]$），在其上方则碱 \\ce{A-} 占优势。\\emph{分布", "图}\\index{分布图} 给出每种形式所占的分数，", "即 $[\\ce{HA}]/c$ 与 $[\\ce{A-}]/c$ 随 pH 的变化；两条曲线在", "$\\mathrm{pH} = pK_a$ 处相交。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[绘制优势区域图]\\label{met:g12:buffers-predominance:diagram}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 画一条从 0 到 14 的 pH 轴，并标出共轭对的 $pK_a$。", "  \\item 在 $pK_a$ 左侧写出酸，右侧写出碱。", "  \\item 对于有多个共轭对的物种（如可给出两个质子的酸、氨基酸），", "        标出所有 $pK_a$：每个区间", "        只属于一种形式。", "  \\item 距 $pK_a$ 一个 pH 单位时，两种形式之比已为 10 比 1：次要", "        形式的含量低于 \\qty{10}{\\percent}。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.62cm]", "  % ledger: pka:ethanoic, pka:methanoic, kb:NH3, ka:H2CO3", "  \\foreach \\y/\\pk/\\acid/\\base in {0/3.74/{\\ce{HCOOH}}/{\\ce{HCOO-}},", "      -1.0/4.76/{\\ce{CH3COOH}}/{\\ce{CH3COO-}}, -2.0/6.37/{\\ce{CO2,H2O}}/{\\ce{HCO3-}},", "      -3.0/9.26/{\\ce{NH4+}}/{\\ce{NH3}}} {", "    \\fill[omThm!20] (0,\\y) rectangle (\\pk,\\y+0.5);", "    \\fill[omDef!20] (\\pk,\\y) rectangle (14,\\y+0.5);", "    \\draw[black!50] (0,\\y) rectangle (14,\\y+0.5);", "    \\node at (\\pk/2,\\y+0.25) {\\acid};", "    \\node at ({(\\pk+14)/2},\\y+0.25) {\\base};", "    \\draw[thick] (\\pk,\\y-0.08) -- (\\pk,\\y+0.58);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (\\pk,\\y+0.55) {\\pk};", "  }", "  \\draw[->] (0,-3.4) -- (14.5,-3.4) node[right] {pH};", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14} \\draw (\\k,-3.35) -- (\\k,-3.45) node[below, font=\\scriptsize] {\\k};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四组共轭对的优势区域图：酸（左侧，红色）", "在 $pK_a$ 以下占优势，碱（右侧，蓝色）在其上方占优势。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=\\linewidth, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "    xlabel={pH}, ylabel={分数}, axis lines*=left, ymajorgrids,", "    grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 乙酸},", "    title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "  \\addplot[very thick, omThm] table[x=pH, y=HA] {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef] table[x=pH, y=A] {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!50] coordinates {(4.76,0) (4.76,1)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (axis cs:2.2,0.85) {\\ce{CH3COOH}};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:7.6,0.85) {\\ce{CH3COO-}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=\\linewidth, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "    xlabel={pH}, ylabel={分数}, axis lines*=left, ymajorgrids,", "    grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 甘氨酸},", "    title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "  \\addplot[very thick, omThm] table[x=pH, y=cation] {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-b.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, omMeth] table[x=pH, y=zwitterion] {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-b.dat};", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef] table[x=pH, y=anion] {figdata/out/grade-12-buffers-predominance-b.dat};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm] at (axis cs:1.0,0.55) {阳离子};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omMeth] at (axis cs:6.1,0.88) {两性离子};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:12.6,0.55) {阴离子};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{minipage}", ""]}